# SupplyChainXAI — optional LLM configuration for the Procurement Copilot.
# Without these variables the copilot still works: it falls back to a fully
# grounded template-based narrator that answers strictly from the analytics store.

# Any OpenAI-compatible endpoint works (OpenAI, Azure OpenAI gateways, vLLM, Ollama, ...)
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# SCX_LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
